{"id":"263e6b700ce2f25e","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Dependent Choice Sequence","display":"df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence — ZFC Dependent Choice Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence — ZFC Dependent Choice Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence — ZFC Dependent Choice Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (choice domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(R\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span> (successor relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span> (dependent-choice sequence graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}choice\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x(n),x(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}choice\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x(n),x(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate defines an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-chain; the seriality premise used by the axiom of dependent choice belongs to the corresponding existence theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}choice\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{Function}(x,\\omega,A)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x(n),x(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1067,"backlinks":[{"id":"adf383c642517545","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,X)$ (dependent-choice sequence predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1791","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}